                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "The clerk posts\nthe packet beside\nthe wheel. Private\nrooms remain",
                            "private; public\nservice stays\npublic. Slush asks\nfor clear fault",
                            "reports in return.\nPip accepts the\nduty and names\nMoxie as the",
                            "person who will\ncarry reports if a\nwire fails."
